<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy information for the AIcreation.pro website.">
  <p>Updated 3 October 2026. This notice describes the current AIcreation.pro website. For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@aicreation.pro">hello@aicreation.pro</a>.</p>
  <h2>Website enquiries</h2>
  <p>The enquiry forms validate your details in your browser and prepare an email draft containing your entries. Submitting opens your configured email app on phones and tablets, or a Gmail compose page on desktop browsers. The website does not send the email automatically or submit the form to a server. You choose whether to send the draft. Opening Gmail passes your draft contents to Google, where its privacy policy applies.</p>
  <p>If you email us, your email service and ours process the message. Include only the information needed to discuss your project; please avoid sending sensitive personal information.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and website storage</h2>
  <p>The current website code does not install analytics or advertising trackers, set cookies, or save form entries in browser storage.</p>
  <h2>Hosting and media</h2>
  <p>Loading a website requires the hosting service to receive technical information such as your IP address and browser request. Public video delivery through Supabase is planned but has not yet been connected. This notice will need updating when hosting, form delivery or additional services change.</p>
  <h2>Your questions</h2>
  <p>You can contact us about information you have shared by email, including requests to access, correct or delete it. This website notice does not describe a client project's data processing; that should be addressed in the relevant project agreement.</p>
</LegalLayout>
